cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research compendium, please cite it as below."
title: "Marine Fisheries Data Cube: Marine Heatwaves, Ocean Productivity and Fishing Effort along the Brazilian Coast"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gregory"
    given-names: "Valber"
    email: "valber.gregory@gmail.com"
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-03"
abstract: >
  Reproducible R-first geospatial research compendium integrating fishing
  effort, sea-surface temperature, marine heatwaves, ocean productivity,
  marine protected areas, ports and territorial characteristics to study
  how environmental shocks alter the intensity and spatial distribution of
  fishing effort along the Brazilian coast.
keywords:
  - marine heatwaves
  - fishing effort
  - fisheries economics
  - spatial econometrics
  - information systems
  - Brazil
license: MIT
